ng\n\n2. `/app/workspace/src/main/resources/log4j.properties` (1.2 KB)\n   - Log4j2 logging configuration for console output\n\n**Data Files:**\n1. `/app/workspace/data/ClusterData2011_2.md` (4.1 KB)\n   - Documentation about Google's Cluster Data 2011-2 trace\n   - 29 days of data from May 2011, ~12.5k machines\n   - References v2.1 format and schema document\n\n2. `/app/workspace/data/format.pdf` (387 KB)\n   - Format specification document for cluster data\n\n3. `/app/workspace/data/job_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz` (123 KB)\n   - Compressed job events data (1 of 500 partitions)\n\n4. `/app/workspace/data/task_events/part-00001-of-00500.csv.gz` (903 KB)\n   - Compressed task events data (1 of 500 partitions)\n\n### Project Overview\n\nThis is a **Cluster Data Analysis** project using Apache Flink for stream processing. It processes Google's public cluster data trace from 2011, analyzing job and task events. The main application class is `LongestSessionPerJob`, which appears to be designed to find the longest session duration per job using Flink's streaming API. The project includes both sample data files (gzip-compressed CSV) and documentation about the data format."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a018ce4 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)"}]}]},"uuid":"a9ab1474-b663-4299-9fe4-b40a310c7877","timestamp":"2026-02-07T06:01:24.522Z","toolUseResult":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the project structure under /app/workspace/. List all files, especially Java source files, pom.xml, and data files. Show the directory tree.","agentId":"a018ce4","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Here's a comprehensive overview of the project structure:\n\n## Project Structure Summary\n\nThe project is located at `/app/workspace/` and is a Maven-based Java application using Apache Flink for stream processing of Google Cluster Data.\n\n### Directory Tree\n```\n/app/workspace/\n├── pom.xml\n├── src/\n│   └── main/\n│       ├── java/\n│       │   └── 